Alembic migrations for the EASA API. Run commands from apps/api, e.g.:

    uv run alembic upgrade head
    uv run alembic current
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

The database URL comes from EASA_DATABASE_URL / apps/api/.env (see
app/core/config.py), never from alembic.ini. Review every autogenerated
migration before committing it.
